The selected-day event distribution workflow needed a way to copy existing events from the user's marked calendar days into a friend's calendar on the corresponding dates.

The implemented Share Events flow adds a new step between Select/Mark Days and Read Events. After marking days, the user can open a friend checklist, select one or more friends, and share events from each marked day into the matching day on each selected friend's calendar. By default every event from the marked days is shared; when Select Events is enabled, only the checked event rows are shared. The server validates that every selected recipient is an actual friend before cloning events, preserving event details such as title, date, hour, priority, note, link, completion state, resources, and unlock date.
